{"3372040":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"TRAUMATA","steam_appid":3372040,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>🪙 REWARDS FOR OUR GAME VETERANS! 🪙<\/h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play our previous games and get up to 14,000 Traumacoins in TRAUMATA! The bonus currency is automatically credited when you launch the game, as long as the requirements are met.<br><br>How it works (1,000 Traumacoins per game):<br>• The game is in your Steam library.<br>• You have at least <u>2 hours<\/u> of playtime in it.<br>• +1,000 extra Traumacoins can be claimed for completing the TRAUMATA Demo.<br>The reward stacks for all 13 past studio titles + the Demo. This offer never expires - you can buy our older games at any time, play for 2 hours, and claim your Traumacoins!<\/strong><\/h2><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/cde255a1012a903e2e04a64187f5a240.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=219 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>TRAUMATA is pure, concentrated adrenaline! A thrill-packed psychological thriller and a mind-bending blockbuster designed to test your reaction speed to its absolute limits!<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/f1afcea21bd41092d31582e42e12519f.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive deep into the underbelly of psychological horror. Every mystery solved brings you closer to ascension... or drags you down into the abyss of madness! Are you ready to face your darkest fears?<\/strong><\/h2>✔️ <strong>100% Pure Drive<\/strong> - No filler, no downtime. Just non-stop, adrenaline-fueled action from the very first second!<br>✔️ <strong>Endless Waves of Death<\/strong> - Test your limits and survive against an escalating onslaught!<br>✔️ <strong>A Grim Variety of Foes<\/strong> - Study the twisted behaviors of horrific creatures and adapt your tactics on the fly!<br>✔️ <strong>Built for Multitasking<\/strong> - Windowed mode allows you to crush monsters while catching up on your favorite stream!<br>✔️ <strong>Bite-Sized Sessions<\/strong> - Concentrated gaming experience packed with pure emotions!<br>✔️ <strong>Total Performance Tracking<\/strong> - In-depth, crystal-clear statistics for your glorious victories!<br>✔️ <strong>Fight for the Top<\/strong> - Climb the global Steam Leaderboards and show the entire world who dominates the arena!<br>✔️ <strong>The Ultimate Action<\/strong> - Forget complex combos. Just click, obliterate enemies, and enjoy the chaos!<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/3627d6728c952d280229581b3c29bf62.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/cde255a1012a903e2e04a64187f5a240.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=219 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>TRAUMATA is pure, concentrated adrenaline! A thrill-packed psychological thriller and a mind-bending blockbuster designed to test your reaction speed to its absolute limits!<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/f1afcea21bd41092d31582e42e12519f.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive deep into the underbelly of psychological horror. Every mystery solved brings you closer to ascension... or drags you down into the abyss of madness! Are you ready to face your darkest fears?<\/strong><\/h2>✔️ <strong>100% Pure Drive<\/strong> - No filler, no downtime. Just non-stop, adrenaline-fueled action from the very first second!<br>✔️ <strong>Endless Waves of Death<\/strong> - Test your limits and survive against an escalating onslaught!<br>✔️ <strong>A Grim Variety of Foes<\/strong> - Study the twisted behaviors of horrific creatures and adapt your tactics on the fly!<br>✔️ <strong>Built for Multitasking<\/strong> - Windowed mode allows you to crush monsters while catching up on your favorite stream!<br>✔️ <strong>Bite-Sized Sessions<\/strong> - Concentrated gaming experience packed with pure emotions!<br>✔️ <strong>Total Performance Tracking<\/strong> - In-depth, crystal-clear statistics for your glorious victories!<br>✔️ <strong>Fight for the Top<\/strong> - Climb the global Steam Leaderboards and show the entire world who dominates the arena!<br>✔️ <strong>The Ultimate Action<\/strong> - Forget complex combos. Just click, obliterate enemies, and enjoy the chaos!<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372040\/extras\/3627d6728c952d280229581b3c29bf62.avif?t=1793642443\" width=944 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"TRAUMATA is pure, concentrated adrenaline! Dive into the underbelly of psychological horror where every secret brings you closer to ascension... or drags you into the abyss of madness. Fight off endless waves, master the ultimate action, and domina